WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:04.916
Oh, my sweet summer league child

00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:07.916
What do you know about fear?

00:00:08.916 --> 00:00:10.875
Fear is for the winter

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:13.875
when the injuries start piling up

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.416
Fear is for the long night

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:22.500
when you don't even feel safe in your own locker room

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:24.500
Lord Commander!

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.875
Fear is for that time you scored 70 points

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:30.083
and it still wasn't enough

00:00:30.638 --> 00:00:34.347
Fear is when you realize your banner says Kings

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:37.925
but you're surrounded by paupers

00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:41.169
Fear is when you're tanking

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.836
and you don't even have a draft pick

